  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Performance Reporting Norms for EMDEs (Impact Frontiers)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the capacity of investor networks in EMDEs to participate in the development of impact reporting standards and implement them once developed. This will contribute to greater integration of impact into decision-making by asset owners and allocators to meet the Sustainable Development Goals.</narrative>
  </description>
